<title>JAPAN: Maspro Denkoh trade to be briefly suspended -- TSE.</title>
<headline>Maspro Denkoh trade to be briefly suspended -- TSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that trading in shares of Maspro Denkoh Corp will be temporarily suspended for the first half hour of Thursday's session due to technical reasons.</p>
<p>The bourse said that Maspro Denkoh is set to offer 200,000 shares in the company for 1,510 yen per share during the half hour preceding the opening of Thursday's trade.</p>
<p>Investors are each allowed to purchase up to 200 shares in the firm, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
